cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "pmid-to-citation: PubMed citations from the NCBI Entrez API as reference text"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Holtgrewe
    given-names: Manuel
    email: manuel.holtgrewe@medgen-mainz.de
    affiliation: "Limbach Genetics eGbR, Medizinische Genetik Mainz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/medgen-mainz/pmid-to-citation"
url: "https://pmid-to-citation.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"
abstract: >-
  pmid-to-citation fetches PubMed records from the NCBI Entrez API by PMID,
  validates them into type-annotated models, and renders them as
  citation/reference text (initially in Nature style).
keywords:
  - bibliography
  - citation
  - Entrez
  - NCBI
  - PubMed
  - reference management
license: MIT
